00:10:31.475 --> 00:10:33.347
<v Host>In Chinese.

00:10:33.947 --> 00:10:38.244
<v Host>That's all for today. Thanks for listening, and see you tomorrow.

00:10:38.844 --> 00:10:41.244
<v News>また明日。
